{
  "_about": "Every package of the stock redroid 14 image is core (kept), in one feature (kept only with --with <feature>) or removed (never kept). The unit test fails on an unclassified or duplicated package. Core also holds packages the system refuses to boot without (android.ext.services is kept as a suspected one; com.android.sdksandbox: the package manager throws unless exactly one SDK sandbox package exists, so the system server loops on its next start). The launcher is core too: sys.boot_completed is only set once a home activity is idle, so without it the device never finishes booting after a restart. Settings is core as well: it holds FallbackHome, the home activity used during direct boot before the launcher can start.",
